{"summary":"A Bullet Hell Dungeon Climber","description":"[THIS IS A FREE DEMO with unlimited play of the first area! Unlock the full game with a single in app-purchase! Every item discovered in the demo will carry to the full version! No Gems, Hearts or Coins required!]\n\nExit the Gungeon is a bullet hell dungeon climber immediately following the adventures of the misfit ‘Gungeoneers’ and their journey for personal absolution in Enter the Gungeon. The Gungeon has become a paradox and is collapsing! Armed with an ever-changing weapon, an insatiable need to loot, and the trusty dodge roll, each of our heroes must ascend and escape via their own unique route of increasingly perilous elevators. Battle against the last and most bitter of the Gundead at a frantic pace, slowing down just long enough to chat with some familiar faces… and a few new ones. Shifting rooms, enemies, bosses, bizarre weapons and items all combine to ensure that no two attempts to Exit the Gungeon are the same.\n\nAlso, you can wear hats. Everybody loves hats, and spin-offs, which this game is… of Enter the Gungeon.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Mild Language, Use of Tobacco","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence, Fear","iapPrices":"$4.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hPWFkHynLrc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i6kTFwohWqg7pXwlN7bf-oEEaD25-CjwSNeTMhWqkyvG8JcKSiTg9651hJsgebskyD-inCHuUYJcN0PnbcTyAw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bA7qiVG8dF8lA30tRiF4F5kfmoOQuYiM2jRev1UgRm4wOXF1dhXLTR2YGD-gH-2rF0TByOmVBu5EmbqpKKagPg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VRw5obp68RyuuImKwt_LiCYVSdfjkiIBcitiws1Q-ywXCgP0sRcW1AnG93_9JbXsUOdN9cCCDeIwIKO1l3La","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bK6Ly6FNN-ssn-ysw5nEcQuGug3Nf2TvmQy4TjVI9KvxIqSWxaAGZJzxdEDMUi39LUufWV3Ol-wsVapIL_KpuoY","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gedXtN8EImN2B9gSnorOe1z_h_u1U-Fj_SlsSdEj12T_mOQhsEOPB5s2XpMbmT_6NCThqTRbARzlqi0eyOCcBQ","https://play-lh.googleu